    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010All characters in the game are over 18 years old\u3011<br>Note: This game is not a complete version and will be updated later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is not yet a complete version. Some features are not yet complete. We will update this later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is a Discord group link on the right panel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/cd27d9a2a504c14ac58d93673c82740f.avif?t=1755514129\" width=800 height=1439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will play as the protagonist \u3010Zhu\u3011. Zhu loves to fantasize... dreaming of wealth, glory, and being surrounded by thousands of beautiful women...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in reality, he's penniless and has to pay high rent every week. Under such pressure, what choices will the player-controlled character make?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can encounter the landlord\u2019s daughter \u3010Xiaoqian\u3011, the twin sisters \u3010Xiaoyue and Xiaoyou\u3011, and the landlady, depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will trigger different reactions and endings. \u3010The game has multiple endings\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/105832a9a4dec47eac33d0d7c6fa9bef.avif?t=1755514129\" width=800 height=1439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introductions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/fe932e486ce0f5354ed4d0dde2d1d2fc.avif?t=1755514129\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Xiaoyue\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the twin sisters that Zhu meets, known for her playful personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/8ab55fa4f598b84b89c0fbc6846717b1.avif?t=1755514129\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Xiaoyou\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the twin sisters that Zhu meets. She is shyer than her sister, but in some ways, has a hidden side unknown to others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/41e471ac5ca9f315793435174b23fd81.avif?t=1755514129\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Xiaoqian\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The landlord\u2019s daughter, Xiaoqian, has an impressive figure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/2dbfdc54220f69cdc3198ecff67bc038.avif?t=1755514129\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Qianyuan\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The landlady and Xiaoqian\u2019s mother. She\u2019s usually calm while doing business, but becomes very fierce when the rent is overdue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668800/extras/ebedeb422cd0569deadb4cb373116aab.avif?t=1755514129\" width=800 height=1439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a time and stats-driven game. For example, \u3010Workout Points\u3011 and \u3010Fantasy Points\u3011. Different values at different times will trigger different results. The game will unlock different plots based on your different actions<